{"id":"d44250cf939954acdb933039bbbfbafe6d3cf32f","url":"https://www.leiphone.com/category/private/yXsTeayhNBwW2ZUH.html","title":"给黑盒导航机器人「使绊子」：AdvNav 如何揭示具身智能系统潜在安全风险 | GAIR Paper 117","site_name":"TopHub","source":"Readhub · AI","byline":null,"excerpt":"AdvNav 首次在黑盒条件下，对导航智能体完成系统性安全验证。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n                                                <!-- 123 -->\n                        \n                        \n                                                \n                        <!-- AI影响因子 -->\n                        <!-- xhBPeYDbNuuRZkwy -->\n                                                <!-- AI影响因子 -->\n                        <!-- 正文内容 -->\n                        <section data-mpa-action-id=\"mmiwq6ij1i3r\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img alt=\"给黑盒导航机器人「使绊子」：AdvNav 如何揭示具身智能系统潜在安全风险 | GAIR Paper 117\" data-src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260813/6a7d8725117dc.jpg\" data-ratio=\"0.55\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1000\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/XqAicMdcoiafMbsa3dCps6jBKu29AWhdjKOicibjNJiajmy6A209mQTCY5o8SSibGIk9w2jeFj9rId1EaiaEnXGrB7zDCD2gPjAssQDicCFV11DzWbM/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"546\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"307\" data-imgfileid=\"100257473\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260813/6a7d8725117dc.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90\"></section><section data-pm-slice=\"5 10 []\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mmix4tgk1t7p\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-data-temp-type=\"image\" mpa-data-temp-power-by=\"yiban.io\" data-mpa-template=\"t\" data-mid=\"\"><section><section><span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mmix6wyl1l05\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">AdvNav 首次在黑盒条件下，对导航智能体完成系统性安全验证。</span></span></span></span></section><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mqgbkegzw9n\"></span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mpmlbwxl8oz\"></span><span dat